%% Save as call_flow.mmd and render in Mermaid
flowchart TD
  A[Greeting] --> B{Collect required fields}
  B -->|Missing full_name| B1[Ask full_name]
  B -->|Missing address| B2[Ask service_address]
  B -->|Missing phone| B3[Ask phone_number]
  B -->|Missing email| B4[Ask email]
  B -->|Missing service| B5[Ask service_request]
  B -->|Missing date| B6[Ask date]
  B -->|Missing time| B7[Ask time_window]
  B -->|All present| C[Check availability]
  C -->|Available| D[Recap all fields]
  C -->|Busy| C1[Suggest alternatives]
  C1 --> C
  D --> E{User confirms?}
  E -->|Yes| F[Create appointment + Send confirmation]
  E -->|No| B
  F --> G[Goodbye]
